@crew moreau-signe
// Signe Moreau (she/her), Works technician, days. The Works writer, batch 2. Brisk, sharp; rowing, mysteries.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hey. New hand. Check the seal before you close a panel. Every time. You'll thank me.
- Right, you. Read the whole job card before you take it. The last line bites.
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Morning. Rowed before breakfast. Two seconds off. Vance's name is still up there.
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}. Your panel on Deck 4's not flush. Left corner. Go and look. I'll wait.
? tier>=colleague
- {me}. Chapter two and I know who did it. The cook. It's always the cook.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- {me}. Good. You're the only one who doesn't spoil the ending. Sit.   #warm

== bye
- Go on. See you on the board.
- Off you go. And check that seal.

== feel
? mood:low
- Dropped a place on the leaderboard. Santos. Fair's fair. I'll be back.
? mood:high
- Guessed the ending. Wrong. Completely wrong. Best book in months.   #funny

== near
? act:work
- Hold that. No, lower. There. See the crack? Nobody else saw that crack.
? act:gym
- Five hundred metres. Don't talk to me. Talk to me after.

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- Vance moved to the treadmill. We think he's scared of the rowing board. We're right.   #funny
? tier>=colleague
- Achterberg, Quist and I swap mysteries. Then we ruin them for each other. It's lovely.   #funny

== joy
? tier>=acquaintance
- The moment in a mystery when you know. Right or wrong. That's the best page.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 1: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:evening
- Evening. Your sleeve's caught on something. Grease, by the look. Bench three.
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- There you are. You've been off the board for days. I noticed. I notice things.

== near
? habit:gym-regular
- Gym after shift now. Rowing, then weights. Santos is ahead. Not for long.
? habit:music
- Music room. I'm allowed to be soft about one thing. This is the thing.

== invite
? tier>=acquaintance
- Gym after shift? Rowing. I'll set the pace. You'll hate me. Then you'll thank me.   #funny
? tier>=colleague
- Friday jam. Sit with me. I'll tell you which song comes next. I'm always right.

== accept
- Yes. Good. Be on time. I'll know.
- Fine. I'm in. Bring that book back while you're at it.

== decline
- Can't. I'm on the rower at seven. Tomorrow.
? weekday:sat|sun
- Rest day. One book, the whole thing. I'll have guessed by lunch. Another time.   #funny

== missed
- You didn't turn up. I noticed. I notice everything. Next time, yes?

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday. I got you a mystery. I haven't read it. That's my present to you.   #funny
? birthday:me
- My birthday. Achterberg gave me a book with the last page torn out. Best present ever.   #funny

== cue
? cue:repair.you@dept
- I checked your seal. It's good. I'd have said if it wasn't.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 1b: a hint (a moment is ready) and an about line for a named friend
== hint
- Find me after shift. I need someone who'll be straight with me. That's you.

== about
? aff:achterberg-lars:friend
- Achterberg lends me mysteries with the ending circled. I never look. Mostly.   #funny

// ---- Writer 2, batch 6: bubbles (smalltalk, rumour), at most one in five about work. 60 characters.
== smalltalk
- Two seconds off the row. Santos, beware.
- Chapter two. It's the cook.   #funny
- Book swap. Nobody spoil it. Achterberg.   #funny
? trad:jam
- Friday jam. I'll know the next song.
? act:work
- That seal's not flush. Left corner.
?

== rumour
- I spotted this first. Obviously.
- Straight version, no fuss.

// Writer 4, batch 11: goodbyes (leaving:you), packing (leaving:soon) and letters after they've moved on.
== feel
? leaving:soon
- Packing. Quickly. I spotted the shuttle's late. It's late.

== goodbye
? leaving:you tier>=acquaintance
- Off soon. Keep my rowing time warm. I'll beat it from here.
? leaving:you tier>=friend
- You were a good rival on the board. And a better shipmate. Don't tell anyone I said that.   #warm

== letter
- New ship has a rowing board. I'm top. Took a week. Finished a mystery. Guessed it on page four.
? tier>=friend
- Lars sent me a book with the last page in. A first. Tell him I noticed. Music's not the same here.
